{
  "_doc": "Personal access token format (docs/contracts/auth/README.md, Personal access tokens). A token is the prefix qq_pat_ and 64 lowercase hex characters (32 random bytes). The server stores only hex(sha256(whole string)) and the hint: the 6 hex characters after the prefix. Strings here are test values, never real tokens. Decoded by apps/web/src/lib/account/tokensFormat.test.ts and server/internal/auth/tokens_test.go.",
